    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kwiganika kūshoka kaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū Yakobo wandya kwigwa gīkī, a bitūnja ba ng'wa Labani bakūhayaga, “Ū Yakobo wīsolile pyī ī sabo ya ng'wa sīswe; nīyo pyī ū būsabi ūbo alī nabo wenūbū wabūpandīkile kūfuma mu shikolo sha ng'wa sīswe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo ū Yakobo wandya kūmona ū Labani gīkī wagalūkile; ū būyegi bokwe ū kūlī we boshilile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū SEEBA nang'hwe ū mu shikū jenījo ūng'wīla ū Yakobo gīkī, “Shokaga kū sī ya babyaji bako, na badūgūyo; nane nakūbiza hamò nang'ho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūbitana a ba Laheli nū Leya, bize ū kū madīīmīlo, ūko gaalī a madaale gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Nandije kūbona gīkī ū sīng'we wagalūkile ī haha, ū būyegi bokwe ū kūlī nene boshilile. Alīyo ū Mulungu wa ng'wa baba alī hamò nū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumanile ūmo nakūntūmamīlaga ū sīng'we na nguzu jane jose; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo ū sīng'we wakwījaga ī ng'hangala ja kūninyeekeja ī mheela yane; jashikaga a h'ikūmi! Gwike ū Mulungu atang'wiloleelile dūhū gīkī anīītīle yabūbi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno walūbizaga ūlū wahaya gīkī, “Ī ja mabbado hū jikūbiza mheela yako; pyī ī lidaale lyabyala ja mabbado. Ūlū wahaya gīkī, ‘Ī ja mikwanga mikwanga hū jikūbiza mheela yako,’ hangī na a hene pyī ī lidaale lyabyala ja mikwaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya ū Mulungu wantaagije ū sīng'we ī mitugo, ūninha nene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu shikū ījo mitugo jikipandaga no no no, ikanza ilebe nakaloota; ū mu shilooti shenīsho aho nabūūcha a miso nūjibona ī ng'hulyati ījo japandaga, jalī ja mikwanga mikwanga na ja mabbado na ja būgondo būgondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa ng'wa Mulungu akanitana aho nalī ū mu shilooti; ūhaya, Yakobo! Nane nidīka, “Nene aha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Alibūūchaga a miso ūlole ū ng'widaale; ūlījibona ī ng'hulyati ījo jilīpanda gīkī pye jilī na mikwanga mikwanga na mabbado na būgondo būgondo! Nguno pyī īyo akūkwītīlaga ū Labani nībonile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī Mulungu wa Beeseli, ūko ūkitīīla maguta h'iwe ūtūūla na shilahīlo ūlīniilahīlīla nene. Na lūūlū, īngaga wangū ū mu sī īyī; ūje kū sī ya ng'wing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a ba Laheli nū Leya būnshokeja balīhaya, “A bise tūtaalī na ngabo kī ū mu wingīji wa sabo ya ng'wa sīswe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ī haha atūtwisaabaga gītī tūlī babisa dūhū? Nguno atagelelile ha kūtūjinja dūhū, alīyo nī sabo ja būkwiwa wise wajimalile pye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya gīkī pyī ī sabo īyo Mulungu wang'wīngīgije ū sīswe, h'īyo īlī wingīji wise, hamò na baana bise. Ītaga dūhū ū bebe būlī mhayo ūyo Mulungu wakūwīlile kūgwīta.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūntoloka Labani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo atadīlile, ūbadamhīja ha ngamīla a bake bakwe na a baana bakwe; ūbūūka lūgendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūjitula pyī ī mitugo jakwe, ūsola nī shikolo ī shingī pyī īsho walī wapandīka mu Padani-alamu; ūja kūlī ise Isaka mu sī ya Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani wasangwa atīho ī shikū jenījo; walī waja kūbbutīla ng'holo jakwe booya. Ū Laheli wiba shikolo sha ng'wa ise, sha kwilamīlīgīja ha kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya ya henaho ū Yakobo nang'hwe ūbiza wang'wijomboka ū Labani ū muna Alamu; nguno ataamanije ī gīkī alīhaya kwīnga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yakobo ūbiza watoloka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha lūshikū lwa kadatū lwaho, ū Labani ūwīlwa gīkī ū Yakobo watolokile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbilinga badūgūye, ūbūūka nabo būnkūūbīja ū Yakobo; kūshisha ikanza lya shikū mpungatī, nose būūkampandīkīla kū ngūlū ja Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mulungu ūng'wizīīla mu shilooti sha būjikū ū Labani ū muna Alamu; ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ilang'hange ūtizūng'wīla mhayo gose gose ū Yakobo; gūbize gwawiza nūūlū gwabūbi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo walī wakoma ng'hambī yakwe ū mu ngūlū ja Gileadi aho alīmpandīka ū Labani. Ū Labani na a badūgū bakwe nang'hwe ūtūūla henaho ī ng'hambī yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Labani ūng'wīla ū Yakobo gīkī, “Mhayo kī ū gwenūyū wagwītile? Nibūlī wanitolokile, na a bashīke bane ūbasola gītī banhū ba kūding'wa mu būlūgū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kinehe wīngile mu wiba wiba ūnitoloka? Nibūlī ūtanimanije, ninakūlagile mu būyegi na mbina, hamò na ng'oma na ndono jikūtūlagwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtaninhile nūūlū ng'wanya gwa kūbalaga na kūbabbipa a bizūkūlū bane, na a bashīke bane! Ū mhayo ūyo wagwītile gwenūyū gwa nyabbūūlī no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī nabo gete ū būdūla wa kūkwītīla ī yabūbi, alīyo ū būjikū ūbo wachaaga wenūbū, ū Mulungu wa ng'wa so walī waniwīla gīkī, ‘Ilang'hange ūtizūng'wīla mhayo gose gose ū Yakobo; gūbize gwawiza nūūlū gwabūbi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha ūūyū ūlīja kū kaya ya ng'wing'we, nguno wakūmbūlile kūja kūlī so. Hama lūūlū nahene nibūlī wanibile ī shikolo shane sha kwilamīlīgīja?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūnshokeja ū Labani gīkī, “Nakogoha nguno nakiganika gīkī ūkūnitaaja a bashīke bako bo nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī ya shikolo shako sha kwilamīlīgīja, ūlū ūlampandīke ose ose alī nasho atikala mpanga. Lolaga kū būtongi wa badūgū bise baba aha; ūlū nalī na shikolo shako shose shose a henaha, shisolage.” Gwike ū Yakobo walī atamanile gīkī ū Laheli walī washisola ī shikolo shenīsho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlomolomo bo ng'wa Laheli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Labani ūja ū ng'wiheema lya ng'wa Yakobo, nī lya ng'wa Leya, nū mu maheema ga bakīma a basese a babīlī; atabonile moi shose shose. Aho wafuma ū ng'wiheema lya ng'wa Leya, wingīla mu lya ng'wa Laheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū Laheli h'ūyo walī washisola ī shikolo sha kwilamīlīgīja ha kaya, ūshibunga mu myenda ya kūtūūla ha ngongo gwa ngamīla kūlwa kwigasīja, hūna ūshigasīja. Ū Labani akakundagūla hose pyī ū ng'wiheema akūlolaga, alīyo atashibonile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Laheli ūng'wīla ū ise gīkī, “Baba ūtizūsaaya īkī nigashaga dūhū; naalemeelagwa ū kūbūūka mu miso gako, nguno nalī ng'wikanza lya bakīma.” Na lūūlū ongeja kūlola lola mo pye a hose, alīyo atashibonile ī shikolo sha kwilamīlīgīja shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūsaaya no, ūng'oolomya ū Labani alīng'wīla gīkī, “Ī gete mhayo kī ūyo naakūkenije? Naakūhūbile kī, kūshisha nose ūlīnikūūbīlīja gīkī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ī haha ūūyū wafunangūla pyī ī shikolo shane; wapandīka shikolo kī lūūlū ī shako? Shitūūlage ha ng'wape kū būtongi wa badūgū bako na bane aha batūloje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nikalile hamò nang'ho ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī; ū ng'wikanza lyose lyenīlo ī ng'holo nī mbūli jako jitagemile kūtaaj nūūlū hado. Natalyile ng'ondi nūūlū īmò dūhū kwīngīīla ng'widaale lyako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī ja kūlyiwa mashiinū natizile nakwilīja lījaga, ū būjimīīja wenūbo nabūbūūchaga nene dūhū. Nī jijo jibagwa, ībize līīmi nūūlū būjikū, wanihadīkījaga kūjilīpa nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo yajīīlaga ī mihayo yane; a makanza ga līīmi, h'ūmo līsebele ī līīmi, lyanigatīīlaga. Ī mbeho ya būjikū nayo yanidīkīla pyī ūmo īgelelile, kūshisha nī tūlo yatalaga ū mu miso gane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo kaalī a kikalīle kane aho nakūkūtūmamīlaga ū ng'wikanza lya myaka yose makūmi abīlī, aho nalī mu kaya yako. Naamala myaka ikūmi n'īnè nakūkūtūmamīlaga kūlwa bashīke bako, na myaka ītandatū kūlwa mitugo jako. Washisha ng'hangala ikūmi ūkūgalūchaga ī mheela yane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ni atī ū Mulungu wa ng'wa baba, ū Mulungu wa ng'wa Abulahamu, ūyo alī lyogohya lya ng'wa baba Isaka; ūlū ni atī hamò nane ū ng'wenūyo, tambala shilanga ni wanipeegije makono dalali gete. Alīyo ū Mulungu abūbonile ū būluhi bone nū būdimu bo milīmo īyo naalūtūmamaga na makono gane. H'ī nguno yene walī wakūhama ū būjikū bo lelo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlagana Yakobo na Labani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūnshokeja ū Yakobo gīkī, “Ū bebe ūmanile gete, gīkī a bakīma benaba bashīke bane, na a baana bane, nī lidaale lya mitugo nī lyene lyane; īsho ūlīshibona a henaha pyī shane dūhū. Alīyo nahene ī lelo yenīyī nadūgije kūbīītīla mhayo kī a bashīke bane aba, nūūlū a baana abo bababyala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū nahene, twīmalage nyagosha; tūtūūlage ilagane a ha gatī yako ū bebe nū nene, lībize būkaanīji a ha gatī yise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūsola iwe ūlīsīmbīla lyīmīla gītī ng'hīngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūbawīla a badūgū bakwe gīkī, “Kumingagi mawe;” būkuminga mawe būgatūūla hamò lyūbiza itūūgo. Hanuma ya henaho bigasha kūlya shilīwa haho bbihī nī litūūgo lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūlitana “Jegaali Sahadusa,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:47",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jegaali Sahadusa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jegaali Sahadusa makūlū gaho, itūūgo lya būkaanīji.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ū Yakobo ūlitana “Galeedi.”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Labani ūhaya, “Ī lelo yenīyī ī litūūgo īlī līlī būkaanīji ha hagatī yako nū nene.” H'ī nguno yene līkitanwa “Galeedi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī līkitanwa “Mispa” nguno akahaya gīkī, “Ū SEEBA ni ayīlolage na welwa ng'holò ūmo īlī ī mihayo a ha gatī yise, ū bebe nū nene ūlū tūlalekane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbaluhya a bashīke bane, nūūlū ūtoola bakīma bangī, managa gīkī ū Mulungu alī nkaanīji wise; nūūlū ūbiza atīho munhū ūngī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūng'wīla ū Yakobo gīkī, “Angū ūlībona naatūūla itūūgo lya mawe na ng'hīngī a ha gatī yako nū nene ī lelo yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī litūūgo nī ng'hīngī shilī būkaanīji, gīkī ū nene natīko kūlīkīlanhya ī litūūgo lyenīlī kwiza kūlī bebe kūkwikoloosha. Nū bebe yaya ū kūlīkīlanhya ī litūūgo lyenīlī nī ng'hīngī īyī, kwiza kūlī nene kūniikoloosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu wa ng'wa Abulahamu, na Mulungu wa ng'wa Naholi; ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo ni abizage namuji wise.” Hūna ū Yakobo witonga mu lina lyakwe, ūyo alī Lyogohya lya ng'wa ise Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūfunya shitambo ū mu lūgūlū ng'wenūmo, ūbitana a badūgūye kwiza kūlya ī shilīwa. Būlya ng'hana, hūna bikala ū mu lūgūlū lwenūlo kūshisha weela ū būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:55"
